              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you’re running a business that depends on trucks, the equipment you choose isn’t just important—it’s essential. Whether you’re hauling freight, managing logistic operations, or expanding a service fleet, the right truck equipment can mean the difference between profit and downtime. In Florida, one name continues to stand out for quality, service, and long-term reliability: <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a>.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We’re more than just a dealership. We’re a trusted partner to businesses across Central and Southwest Florida, offering a wide selection of <a href=\"/parts\">parts</a>, <a href=\"/service\">service</a>, and <a href=\"/parts\">truck equipment</a> that keeps your operation moving forward. Here’s why fleet owners, independent operators, and business leaders turn to <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a> when it comes to <a href=\"/parts\">truck equipment</a> in Tampa, Florida.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-range",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A Wide Range of Equipment That Works as Hard as You Do",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "range"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-range-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "No two operations are the same. Whether you’re hauling refrigerated freight or running flatbed deliveries, the needs of your fleet vary—and so should your equipment options. That’s why <a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a> carries a diverse selection of <a href=\"/parts\">truck equipment</a> to support every kind of job. Our parts and <a href=\"/service\">service department</a> can locate any piece of equipment you need, whether it’s OEM or aftermarket; we’ve got you covered. If we don’t have it at one of our locations, we can find it for you. Our experienced team works closely with you to make sure you get the right solution, every time.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-local",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Locally Owned, Nationally Trusted",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "local"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-local-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We’re proud to be a locally owned and operated business in Tampa. That means when you work with <a href=\"/\">Sun State</a>, you’re not calling a corporate call center or submitting tickets to a faceless portal. You’re talking to real people who know your industry, your trucks, and your needs. We’ve built our reputation through consistent service, honest communication, and a hands-on approach to every sales and service job. Customers stick with us because they know we stand behind everything we sell and install. In a world of automated processes and mass suppliers, that level of support still matters.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-technicians",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Expert Technicians With Decades of Experience",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "technicians"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-technicians-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Truck equipment is only as good as its installation, and at Sun State International, we don’t cut corners. Our technicians are factory-trained, certified, and experienced in working on all major brands and models. Whether you’re outfitting a new truck or modifying an older one, you can trust our team to get it done right. It’s not about just selling equipment—we make sure it’s installed into your truck correctly, tested thoroughly, and ready to go the distance. That’s the level of professionalism you get when you work with a dealership that’s committed to your success.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-one-stop",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A One-Stop Shop for All Your Fleet Needs",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "one-stop"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-one-stop-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "<a href=\"/\">Sun State International</a> isn’t just the place to find <a href=\"/parts\">reliable truck equipment</a> in Tampa, Florida—we’re a full-service dealership offering everything you need to support your fleet.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-one-stop-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Need a new or used International® truck? Looking for a reliable repair? We’ve got the <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=new\">inventory</a>, <a href=\"/parts\">tools</a>, and <a href=\"/service\">technicians</a> to keep your business running strong. Our <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=new\">onsite fleet inventory</a>, <a href=\"/parts\">parts department</a>, and <a href=\"/service\">service center</a> are here to make your life easier, so you can focus on the road ahead instead of chasing down vendors.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "links-one-stop-3",
                  "type": "link-cards",
                  "props": {
                    "across": "3",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "label": "INVENTORY",
                        "title": "Fleet Inventory →",
                        "url": "/store/inventory?condition=new",
                        "newTab": false
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "PARTS",
                        "title": "Parts Department →",
                        "url": "/parts",
                        "newTab": false
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "SERVICE",
                        "title": "Service Center →",
                        "url": "/service",
                        "newTab": false
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-turnaround",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Fast Turnaround, Minimal Downtime",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "turnaround"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-turnaround-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We understand the pressures fleet managers face. Every hour a truck is out of commission is money lost. That’s why we prioritize fast turnaround and efficient service on all <a href=\"/service\">truck equipment installations and repairs</a>. From the moment you bring your vehicle in, we’ll communicate clearly, get to work promptly, and keep you informed every step of the way. We’re here to keep your business moving without unnecessary delays.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-turnaround-2-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "co-turnaround-2",
                      "type": "column",
                      "props": {
                        "span": 12
                      },
                      "styles": {
                        "base": {
                          "borderWidth": 1,
